<title>SPAIN: Revised Spanish M4 figures for February.</title>
<headline>Revised Spanish M4 figures for February.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain, which earlier released provisional M4 figures for March, subsequently published revised data as follows:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		   Mar 97	Feb 97	Jan 97</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     2.3	  -0.9	   4.0</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    8.2	  18.2	  21.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Latest month's data are provisional. Previous are both revised. Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis.</p>
</text>
